{{!
    @template enrol_conditional/keyholder

    One holder of the enrolment key, shown in the enrolment key form.

    The picture is core's user_picture() output; the name is plain text and is escaped here. The link to the
    profile is given only when the viewer may open it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * picture - HTML of the user picture, built by the server.
    * fullname - Full name of the key holder, plain text.
    * profileurl - URL of the profile, or null.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "picture": "<img src=\"https://example.com/user.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"userpicture\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\">",
        "fullname": "Manager One",
        "profileurl": "https://example.com/user/profile.php?id=3&course=2"
    }
}}
<span class="enrol_conditional-keyholder">{{{picture}}}{{#profileurl}}<a href="{{profileurl}}">{{fullname}}</a>{{/profileurl}}{{^profileurl}}{{fullname}}{{/profileurl}}</span>
